<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24941" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακηρύσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proclaim by herald,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν διακεκηρυγμένοις</span> in
				<i>declared war,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				10
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσεβὲς εἶναι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					862.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακηρυκεύομαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sell by auction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.21.1
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>celebrate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παροιμία δ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					6.30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
